{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1376538408868746", "organization": {"id": "1371853576003896", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1376538408868746"}]}, "id": "1605645594601152"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1376538408868746", "release_date": 1793413620, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1479419305247322"}, "id": "2377946006342599"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1376538408868746", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1479419305247322"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "1441177149071538", "version": "0.7.0", "version_code": 7, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1792420434, "id": "1442305328958720", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v3", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 3, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1455411374314782"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1376538408868746"}, "id": "1455411374314782", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1376538408868746", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1644144323879267"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29405239329165132", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u8e0f\u4e0a\u6c99\u6ee9\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e13\u4e3a VR \u6253\u9020\u7684\u6c99\u6ee9\u6392\u7403\uff01\u63a5\u4f4f\u53d1\u7403\uff0c\u4e3a\u961f\u53cb\u4f20\u7403\uff0c\u594b\u529b\u6263\u6740\uff0c\u5728 2 \u5bf9 2 \u6bd4\u8d5b\u4e2d\u4e89\u593a\u6bcf\u4e00\u5206\u3002\u300aBeach Volleyball VR\u300b\u8ba9\u4f60\u7684\u52a8\u4f5c\u6210\u4e3a\u6bd4\u8d5b\u6838\u5fc3\uff1a\u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u7136\u7684 VR \u52a8\u4f5c\u5b8c\u6210\u57ab\u7403\u3001\u4f20\u7403\u3001\u53d1\u7403\u3001\u6263\u7403\u548c\u62e6\u7f51\u3002\u7cbe\u51c6\u65f6\u673a\u4e0e\u5de7\u5999\u7ad9\u4f4d\uff0c\u80fd\u8ba9\u4e00\u6b21\u7cbe\u5f69\u7684\u56de\u5408\u53d8\u6210\u5236\u80dc\u4e00\u51fb\u3002\n\n\u6309\u4f60\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u7545\u73a9\n\n\u2022 \u5355\u4eba\u6bd4\u8d5b\uff1a\u4e0e AI \u961f\u4f0d\u8fdb\u884c\u5b8c\u6574\u7684 2 \u5bf9 2 \u6bd4\u8d5b\uff0c\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e09\u79cd\u96be\u5ea6\u3002\u65e0\u9700\u8054\u7f51\uff0c\u968f\u65f6\u5f00\u6253\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u5728\u7ebf\u591a\u4eba\uff1a\u52a0\u5165\u516c\u5f00\u623f\u95f4\uff0c\u6216\u521b\u5efa\u6700\u591a 4 \u4eba\u7684\u79c1\u4eba\u6bd4\u8d5b\u3002\u4e0e\u597d\u53cb\u5e76\u80a9\u4f5c\u6218\u6216\u9694\u7f51\u8f83\u91cf\u3002\u7a7a\u7f3a\u4f4d\u7f6e\u7531\u673a\u5668\u4eba\u8865\u8db3\uff0c\u786e\u4fdd\u6bd4\u8d5b\u987a\u5229\u8fdb\u884c\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u8de8\u5e73\u53f0\u6e38\u73a9\uff1a\u4e0e\u4f7f\u7528\u53d7\u652f\u6301 VR \u5e73\u53f0\u7684\u597d\u53cb\u540c\u573a\u7ade\u6280\u3002\n\n\u5b66\u4e60\u4e0e\u8fdb\u6b65\n\n\u2022 \u8ddf\u968f\u5f15\u5bfc\u6559\u7a0b\uff0c\u638c\u63e1\u79fb\u52a8\u548c\u5404\u9879\u6392\u7403\u57fa\u672c\u52a8\u4f5c\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u6309\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8282\u594f\u7ec3\u4e60\u57ab\u7403\u3001\u4f20\u7403\u3001\u53d1\u7403\u3001\u8fdb\u653b\u548c\u63a7\u7403\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u53ef\u9009\u8f85\u52a9\u8bbe\u7f6e\u8ba9\u79fb\u52a8\u3001\u7ad9\u4f4d\u548c\u7f51\u524d\u51fb\u7403\u66f4\u8f7b\u677e\u3002\n\n\u4e13\u4e3a VR \u8bbe\u8ba1\n\n\u544a\u522b\u6309\u952e\u89e6\u53d1\u7684\u56fa\u5b9a\u62db\u5f0f\u3002\u89c2\u5bdf\u7403\u8def\u3001\u53ca\u65f6\u7ad9\u4f4d\uff0c\u7528\u771f\u5b9e\u52a8\u4f5c\u63a7\u5236\u6392\u7403\uff0c\u5e76\u5373\u65f6\u4f5c\u51fa\u53cd\u5e94\u3002\u4e0d\u8bba\u4f60\u662f\u65b0\u624b\uff0c\u8fd8\u662f\u60f3\u6311\u6218\u597d\u53cb\uff0c\u6bcf\u6b21\u53d1\u7403\u90fd\u610f\u5473\u7740\u4e00\u6b21\u5b8c\u7f8e\u6263\u6740\u7684\u673a\u4f1a\u3002\n\n\u4ece\u8f7b\u677e\u7ec3\u4e60\u5230\u6fc0\u70c8\u5bf9\u6297\uff0c\u60f3\u73a9\u5c31\u73a9\u3002\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u56de\u5408\u90fd\u72ec\u4e00\u65e0\u4e8c\u3002", "short_description": "\u300aBeach Volleyball VR\u300b\u5c06 2 \u5bf9 2 \u6c99\u6ee9\u6392\u7403\u5e26\u5165\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u3002\u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u7136\u7684 VR \u52a8\u4f5c\u5b8c\u6210\u57ab\u7403\u3001\u4f20\u7403\u3001\u53d1\u7403\u3001\u6263\u7403\u548c\u62e6\u7f51\u3002\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e0e AI \u5bf9\u624b\u8fdb\u884c\u5b8c\u6574\u6bd4\u8d5b\uff0c\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u7ebf\u4e0e\u597d\u53cb\u7ec4\u961f\u6216\u5bf9\u6218\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29317284977865956", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Entre na areia e viva o v\u00f4lei de praia feito para VR! Receba o saque, levante para seu parceiro, ataque e dispute cada ponto em partidas 2x2. Em Beach Volleyball VR, seus movimentos comandam o jogo: fa\u00e7a manchetes, levantamentos, saques, ataques e bloqueios com gestos naturais. Tempo de bola e posicionamento fazem a diferen\u00e7a.\n\nJOGUE DO SEU JEITO\n\n\u2022 Solo: Partidas completas 2x2 contra equipes de IA, com tr\u00eas n\u00edveis de dificuldade. Jogue offline, quando quiser.\n\n\u2022 Multiplayer online: Entre em salas p\u00fablicas ou crie partidas privadas para at\u00e9 4 jogadores. Jogue ao lado dos amigos ou contra eles. Bots ocupam vagas livres para manter a partida.\n\n\u2022 Multiplataforma: Jogue com amigos em plataformas de VR compat\u00edveis.\n\nAPRENDA E EVOLUA\n\n\u2022 Siga um tutorial guiado de movimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e fundamentos do v\u00f4lei.\n\n\u2022 Treine manchete, levantamento, saque, ataque e controle de bola no seu ritmo.\n\n\u2022 Ative assist\u00eancias opcionais para facilitar a movimenta\u00e7\u00e3o, o posicionamento e as jogadas na rede.\n\nFEITO PARA VR\n\nEsque\u00e7a os golpes acionados por bot\u00f5es. Leia a jogada, posicione-se, controle a bola com seus movimentos e reaja em tempo real. Seja iniciante ou experiente, cada saque \u00e9 uma nova chance de acertar o ataque perfeito.\n\nDe treinos tranquilos a disputas intensas, entre em quadra quando quiser. Nenhuma jogada \u00e9 igual \u00e0 outra.", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR traz o v\u00f4lei de praia 2 contra 2 para a realidade virtual. Fa\u00e7a manchetes, levantamentos, cortadas, saques e bloqueios com movimentos naturais em VR. Dispute partidas completas contra bots ou jogue online com seus amigos."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "beachvr_foreground_safe_512.png", "id": "4515400798700770", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604370996_4515400802034103_5012605138023743938_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ti1UYa-qkyEQ7kNvwHJwARC&_nc_oc=AdqDOZNhmTMSVismSjDdqcJ8cMBedCsFQz_P7ugltET6b1PW1V_YI6iWlJ6DnbC2h5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlCDjuxAhgJADOu9Dne_CAbfHibuvyBcqynuR1wPxuHQ&oe=6AF9CC89"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "3795881057226250", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_3795881060559583_3482806470090151079_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtqQM_5H9e8Q7kNvwFSO8z2&_nc_oc=AdoaHnx_b4-tL2eJgYR7a3e7MOoPwT8IaaIs4nwMSbFSTn