_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR4DD2eKdCSf6GNzn9N-gDfX8CoMHqMJIo_L6fABQiRtg&oe=6AF9B7B5"}, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": ["volleyball", "beach", "volley", "sand"], "long_description": "Step onto the sand and experience beach volleyball built for VR! Receive the serve, set up your teammate, unleash a spike, and fight for every point in 2v2 matches. Beach Volleyball VR puts your movements at the heart of the action: pass, set, serve, spike, and block using natural VR motions. Precise timing and smart positioning turn a good rally into a winning play.\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n\u2022 Solo matches: Play complete 2v2 games against AI teams with three difficulty levels. No internet connection needed, so you can play anytime.\n\u2022 Online multiplayer: Join public rooms or create private matches for up to 4 players. Team up with friends or face them across the net. Bots fill empty player slots so matches can still go on.\n\u2022 Cross-platform play: Join friends across supported VR platforms.\nLEARN AND IMPROVE\n\u2022 Follow a guided tutorial to learn the fundamentals of movement and each volleyball action.\n\u2022 Train your passing, setting, serving, attacking, and ball control at your own pace.\n\u2022 Enable optional assistance settings for easier movement, positioning, and reaching the net.\nMADE FOR VR\nForget button-triggered volleyball moves. Read each play, get into position, control the ball through your movements, and react in real time. Whether you're new to the sport or want to challenge your friends, every serve starts another chance to land the perfect spike.\nFrom relaxed training sessions to competitive rallies, jump into the action whenever you want. No two rallies are the same.\n", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR brings 2v2 beach volleyball to virtual reality. Pass, set, spike, serve and block using natural VR movements, play complete matches against bots, or jump online and play with friends."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1609432240104026", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Foulez le sable et vivez le beach-volley en VR ! R\u00e9ceptionnez, passez \u00e0 votre partenaire, smashez et disputez chaque point en 2 contre 2. Dans Beach Volleyball VR, vos gestes animent chaque action : r\u00e9ception, passe, service, smash et contre. Le timing et le placement transforment un \u00e9change en point gagnant.\n\nJOUEZ COMME VOUS VOULEZ\n\n\u2022 Solo : Jouez des matchs complets en 2 contre 2 face \u00e0 des \u00e9quipes contr\u00f4l\u00e9es par l'IA, avec trois niveaux de difficult\u00e9. Aucune connexion Internet requise.\n\n\u2022 Multijoueur en ligne : Rejoignez des salons publics ou cr\u00e9ez des matchs priv\u00e9s jusqu'\u00e0 4 joueurs. Jouez avec vos amis ou affrontez-les. Les bots occupent les places libres.\n\n\u2022 Multiplateforme : Retrouvez vos amis sur les plateformes VR compatibles.\n\nAPPRENEZ ET PROGRESSEZ\n\n\u2022 Suivez un tutoriel guid\u00e9 pour apprendre les d\u00e9placements et les gestes essentiels.\n\n\u2022 Entra\u00eenez-vous \u00e0 la r\u00e9ception, \u00e0 la passe, au service, \u00e0 l'attaque et au contr\u00f4le du ballon, \u00e0 votre rythme.\n\n\u2022 Activez des aides facultatives pour faciliter les d\u00e9placements, le placement et le jeu au filet.\n\nCON\u00c7U POUR LA VR\n\nOubliez les actions d\u00e9clench\u00e9es par un bouton. Lisez le jeu, placez-vous, contr\u00f4lez le ballon par vos gestes et r\u00e9agissez en temps r\u00e9el. D\u00e9butant ou comp\u00e9titeur, chaque service est une nouvelle chance de r\u00e9ussir le smash parfait.\n\nDe l'entra\u00eenement tranquille aux \u00e9changes intenses, jouez quand vous voulez. Aucun \u00e9change ne se ressemble.", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR vous plonge dans des matchs de beach-volley 2 contre 2 en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle. R\u00e9ceptionnez, faites des passes, servez, smashez et bloquez avec des gestes VR naturels. Affrontez des bots en match complet ou jouez en ligne avec vos amis."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1447630991761178", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u7802\u6d5c\u306b\u7acb\u3061\u3001VR\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u4f5c\u3089\u308c\u305f\u30d3\u30fc\u30c1\u30d0\u30ec\u30fc\u3092\u4f53\u9a13\u3057\u3088\u3046\uff01\u30b5\u30fc\u30d6\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u3001\u4ef2\u9593\u306b\u30c8\u30b9\u3092\u4e0a\u3052\u3001\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30af\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u30012\u5bfe2\u306e\u8a66\u5408\u3067\u4e00\u7403\u4e00\u7403\u3092\u4e89\u304a\u3046\u3002Beach Volleyball VR\u3067\u306f\u3001\u81ea\u7136\u306aVR\u306e\u52d5\u304d\u3067\u30ec\u30b7\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30c8\u30b9\u3001\u30b5\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30af\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u7e70\u308a\u51fa\u305d\u3046\u3002\u30bf\u30a4\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u3068\u30dd\u30b8\u30b7\u30e7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u304c\u52dd\u8ca0\u3092\u5206\u3051\u308b\u3002\n\n\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u3067\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\n\n\u2022 \u30bd\u30ed\uff1a3\u6bb5\u968e\u306e\u96e3\u6613\u5ea6\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3073\u3001AI\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u30682\u5bfe2\u306e\u30d5\u30eb\u30de\u30c3\u30c1\u3002\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u63a5\u7d9a\u306a\u3057\u3067\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u904a\u3079\u308b\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u30aa\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u5bfe\u6226\uff1a\u516c\u958b\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u6700\u59274\u4eba\u306e\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d9\u30fc\u30c8\u30de\u30c3\u30c1\u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3002\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u7d44\u3093\u3067\u3082\u3001\u5bfe\u6226\u3057\u3066\u3082OK\u3002\u7a7a\u304d\u67a0\u306f\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u304c\u88dc\u5145\u3059\u308b\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u30af\u30ed\u30b9\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\uff1a\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308bVR\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u9593\u3067\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u904a\u3079\u308b\u3002\n\n\u5b66\u3093\u3067\u4e0a\u9054\n\n\u2022 \u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u4ed8\u304d\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u3067\u79fb\u52d5\u3068\u57fa\u672c\u52d5\u4f5c\u3092\u7fd2\u5f97\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u30ec\u30b7\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30c8\u30b9\u3001\u30b5\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30a2\u30bf\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u3067\u7df4\u7fd2\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u79fb\u52d5\u3084\u4f4d\u7f6e\u53d6\u308a\u3001\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u969b\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3092\u52a9\u3051\u308b\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3082\u7528\u610f\u3002\n\nVR\u306a\u3089\u3067\u306f\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\n\n\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3072\u3068\u3064\u3067\u6280\u3092\u51fa\u3059\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u3001\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u3001\u4f53\u306e\u52d5\u304d\u3067\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u64cd\u308a\u3001\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u3067\u53cd\u5fdc\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\u521d\u5fc3\u8005\u3082\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u7af6\u3044\u305f\u3044\u4eba\u3082\u3001\u6bce\u56de\u306e\u30b5\u30fc\u30d6\u304c\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30af\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u308b\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30b9\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\n\n\u6c17\u8efd\u306a\u7df4\u7fd2\u304b\u3089\u767d\u71b1\u306e\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u307e\u3067\u3001\u597d\u304d\u306a\u3068\u304d\u306b\u98db\u3073\u8fbc\u3082\u3046\u3002\u540c\u3058\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u306f\u4e8c\u5ea6\u3068\u306a\u3044\u3002", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR\u3067\u30012\u5bfe2\u306e\u30d3\u30fc\u30c1\u30d0\u30ec\u30fc\u3092VR\u3067\u4f53\u9a13\uff01\u81ea\u7136\u306a\u52d5\u304d\u3067\u30ec\u30b7\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30c8\u30b9\u3001\u30b5\u30fc\u30d6\u3001\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30af\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u7e70\u308a\u51fa\u305d\u3046\u3002AI\u76f8\u624b\u306b\u30d5\u30eb\u30de\u30c3\u30c1\u3092\u697d\u3057\u3080\u3082\u3088\u3057\u3001\u30aa\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u5bfe\u6226\u3059\u308b\u3082\u3088\u3057\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1416835803934856", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u00a1Pisa la arena y vive el voleibol de playa dise\u00f1ado para VR! Recibe el saque, coloca el bal\u00f3n para tu compa\u00f1ero, remata y lucha por cada punto en partidos 2 contra 2. En Beach Volleyball VR, tus movimientos son protagonistas: recibe, coloca, saca, remata y bloquea con gestos naturales. El ritmo y la posici\u00f3n adecuada convierten una buena jugada en un punto ganador.\n\nJUEGA A TU MANERA\n\n\u2022 En solitario: Disputa partidos completos 2 contra 2 contra equipos de IA, con tres niveles de dificultad. Juega sin conexi\u00f3n cuando quieras.\n\n\u2022 Multijugador en l\u00ednea: \u00danete a salas p\u00fablicas o crea partidas privadas de hasta 4 jugadores. Forma equipo con tus amigos o enfr\u00e9ntate a ellos. Los bots completan las plazas vac\u00edas.\n\n\u2022 Juego multiplataforma: Juega con amigos en las plataformas VR compatibles.\n\nAPRENDE Y MEJORA\n\n\u2022 Sigue un tutorial guiado de movimiento y t\u00e9cnicas de voleibol.\n\n\u2022 Practica recepciones, colocaciones, saques, remates y control del bal\u00f3n a tu ritmo.\n\n\u2022 Activa ayudas opcionales para moverte, posicionarte y jugar cerca de la red.\n\nHECHO PARA VR\n\nOlvida los movimientos activados con botones. Lee cada jugada, ub\u00edcate, controla el bal\u00f3n con tu cuerpo y reacciona al instante. Tanto si eres principiante como si quieres desafiar a tus amigos, cada saque es otra oportunidad para lograr el remate perfecto.\n\nEntrena con calma o disfruta de partidos intensos. \u00a1Cada intercambio es diferente!", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR lleva el voleibol de playa 2 contra 2 a la realidad virtual. Recibe, coloca, saca, remata y bloquea con movimientos naturales de VR. Juega partidos completos contra bots o compite en l\u00ednea con tus amigos."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1334193928691148", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ab in den Sand: Erlebe Beachvolleyball, das f\u00fcr VR gemacht ist! Nimm Aufschl\u00e4ge an, spiele deinem Mitspieler den Ball zu, schmettere und k\u00e4mpfe im 2-gegen-2 um jeden Punkt. In Beach Volleyball VR z\u00e4hlt jede Bewegung: Baggern, Pritschen, Aufschlagen, Schmettern und Blocken funktionieren mit nat\u00fcrlichen VR-Gesten. Timing und Stellungsspiel entscheiden \u00fcber den Ballwechsel.\n\nSPIELE, WIE DU WILLST\n\n\u2022 Solo: Spiele vollst\u00e4ndige 2-gegen-2-Matches gegen KI-Teams auf drei Schwierigkeitsstufen. Ganz ohne Internetverbindung.\n\n\u2022 Online-Multiplayer: Tritt \u00f6ffentlichen R\u00e4umen bei oder erstelle private Matches f\u00fcr bis zu 4 Spieler. Spiele mit oder gegen Freunde. Bots f\u00fcllen freie Pl\u00e4tze.\n\n\u2022 Plattform\u00fcbergreifend: Spiele mit Freunden auf unterst\u00fctzten VR-Plattformen.\n\nLERNE UND VERBESSERE DICH\n\n\u2022 Ein gef\u00fchrtes Tutorial erkl\u00e4rt Bewegung und die wichtigsten Volleyballtechniken.\n\n\u2022 \u00dcbe Annahmen, Zuspiele, Aufschl\u00e4ge, Angriffe und Ballkontrolle in deinem Tempo.\n\n\u2022 Optionale Hilfen erleichtern Bewegung, Positionierung und das Spiel am Netz.\n\nF\u00dcR VR ENTWICKELT\n\nVergiss Volleyballaktionen per Knopfdruck. Lies das Spiel, bring dich in Position, steuere den Ball durch deine Bewegungen und reagiere in Echtzeit. Ob Einsteiger oder erfahrener Spieler: Jeder Aufschlag bietet die Chance auf den perfekten Schmetterball.\n\nVon entspanntem Training bis zu packenden Ballwechseln: Du entscheidest, wann du spielst. Kein Ballwechsel gleicht dem anderen.", "short_description": "Beach Volleyball VR bringt Beachvolleyball im 2-gegen-2 in die virtuelle Realit\u00e4t. Baggere, pritsche, schlage auf, schmettere und blocke mit nat\u00fcrlichen VR-Bewegungen. Spiele komplette Matches gegen Bots oder tritt online mit Freunden an."}]}, "developer_name": "Arcane Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://arcanestudio.dev.br/privacypolice/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Arcane Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://arcanestudio.dev.br/beachvolleyballvr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR", "es", "fr", "de", "ja", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1455411374314782"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1098325175986333_3518698127038195393_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p-fqB2gLWQcQ7kNvwGII_ct&_nc_oc=AdoyRLjmr_y8eCC4j3to-SwYoyiDLkMHVRljmsIZRJp-oSoHsI7lbWP2alxST9iva7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNNYv5zB4GqyI214zwhnsd5XPkg6vnSPIGaTCKaLp-lg&oe=6AF9E007"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Beach Volleyball VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topi